Yay!

326
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:23,140
Yay!

327
00:18:23,140 --> 00:18:24,020
Yay!

328
00:18:24,740 --> 00:18:25,080
Yay!

329
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:25,380
Yay!

330
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:25,440
Yay!

331
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:25,500
Yay!

332
00:18:25,500 --> 00:18:25,700
Yay!

333
00:18:25,700 --> 00:18:25,760
Yay!

334
00:18:26,780 --> 00:18:32,500
Yay!

335
00:18:44,940 --> 00:18:46,380
Eeeeeeh!

336
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:47,660
Eeeeeeh!

337
00:18:48,220 --> 00:18:49,420
Eeeeeeh!

338
00:18:49,420 --> 00:18:49,480
Eeeeeeh!

339
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,020
Eeeeeeh!

340
00:18:50,020 --> 00:18:52,720
Eeeeeeh!

341
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:02,000
Eeeeeeh!

342
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:02,060
Eeeeeeh!

343
00:19:02,060 --> 00:19:02,260
Eeeeeeh!

344
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:10,440
You can't even see anything, so it must be some kind of mistake, right?
Because the other day, I really wanted to believe that too...

345
00:19:14,060 --> 00:19:16,000
Honda, pull yourself together, come on!

346
00:19:17,380 --> 00:19:22,580
Senpai, I'm done for.
Even riding my bike doesn't cheer me up.

347
00:19:22,580 --> 00:19:27,420
What are you saying?
It's just your 184th heartbreak.

348
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:32,640
This one's serious, man.
I can't bounce back from this.

349
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:35,500
Honda-san, you haven't been
completely rejected yet, right?

350
00:19:35,500 --> 00:19:38,460
That's right, it's too early to give up.

351
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:43,220
Ryo-chan, rather than moping around here,
wouldn't it be quicker to just ask her directly?

352
00:19:44,060 --> 00:19:46,420
Yeah, you're right. Okay, let's go!

353
00:19:47,100 --> 00:19:49,160
No, no, no, no, no way!

354
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:54,900
You saw him coming home at dawn?

355
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:58,280
I hate to interfere in
your private affairs, but

356
00:19:58,360 --> 00:20:01,480
this guy really wants to
hear it from her own mouth.

357
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:04,440
Senpai, that's not what we agreed on.

358
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:05,600
Just shut up and stay quiet!

359
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:06,800
That man is...

360
00:20:07,900 --> 00:20:09,034
That man is,

361
00:20:09,084 --> 00:20:12,400
someone very important to me.

362
00:20:14,960 --> 00:20:17,060
Since about when have
you been with that person?

363
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:20,200
Since my third year of junior high.

364
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,380
Since junior high.

365
00:20:22,380 --> 00:20:24,780
Isn't that a little too early?

366
00:20:25,300 --> 00:20:26,220
It's normal.

367
00:20:26,820 --> 00:20:30,020
Everyone's been doing it since junior high or high school,
after all.

368
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:33,080
Kids these days start early.

369
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:37,500
I've dated three people so far, though.

370
00:20:37,500 --> 00:20:40,100
I just can't forget my first one.

371
00:20:40,100 --> 00:20:42,560
With that cute face, she says it so bluntly!

372
00:20:44,060 --> 00:20:44,980
And from now on too, always?

373
00:20:50,460 --> 00:20:53,340
Honda, it seems that both you and I

374
00:20:53,340 --> 00:20:55,340
have terrible taste in women.

375
00:20:55,340 --> 00:20:57,040
What a magnificent crash and burn.

376
00:20:57,040 --> 00:20:59,200
Let's drink together tonight.

377
00:21:00,320 --> 00:21:01,120
Y-yes.

378
00:21:03,340 --> 00:21:05,780
Thank you for the fun memories until now.

379
00:21:06,280 --> 00:21:08,160
Sorry for hanging around you so much.

380
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:09,300
Goodbye.

381
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:11,920
N-no way, please wait!

382
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:15,340
Stop! Kind words like that
only make it worse for him!

383
00:21:15,660 --> 00:21:19,420
B-but I really, really like you, Mr. Honda.

384
00:21:19,540 --> 00:21:21,320
Are you trying to two-time her?

385
00:21:21,540 --> 00:21:22,040
Senpai!

386
00:21:22,140 --> 00:21:23,420
Say something already!

387
00:21:23,500 --> 00:21:23,900
Senpai!

388
00:21:26,160 --> 00:21:27,740
Women are always like this!

389
00:21:28,140 --> 00:21:31,300
Ryo-chan, that's enough already.
Come on, let's go.

390
00:21:39,180 --> 00:21:40,060
Please wait.

391
00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:42,240
I'll tell you the truth.

392
00:21:44,300 --> 00:21:45,800
Is there something else?

393
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:47,600
I'm sorry.

394
00:21:48,200 --> 00:21:50,680
Actually, I'm a manga artist.

395
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:52,480
A manga artist?

396
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:55,360
Yes, under the pen name Ai no Miko.

397
00:21:55,360 --> 00:21:56,300
Ai no Miko?

398
00:21:56,300 --> 00:21:58,500
That name sounds familiar.

399
00:21:58,500 --> 00:22:00,520
She's a famous shōjo manga artist.

400
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:06,380
So she's the manga artist
Honda's a huge fan of?

401
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:10,440
So, Olive-chan.

402
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:12,320
Yes, Honda-san?

403
00:22:12,760 --> 00:22:14,020
Olive-chan...

404
00:22:16,260 --> 00:22:17,840
You're really Ai no Miko?

405
00:22:17,840 --> 00:22:20,680
I thought you'd be much older.

406
00:22:21,140 --> 00:22:23,740
I've been drawing since my
third year of junior high.

407
00:22:24,340 --> 00:22:26,220
Isn't that what you said earlier?

408
00:22:26,220 --> 00:22:29,580
I made my professional debut
in my third year of junior high.

409
00:22:31,380 --> 00:22:32,800
Your first... guy, then?

410
00:22:33,340 --> 00:22:36,620
He's been my assigned
editor ever since I debuted,

411
00:22:36,620 --> 00:22:37,960
Ryusenshi-san.

412
00:22:38,540 --> 00:22:40,480
That handsome man isn't my lover,

413
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:42,380
he's my editor, I see.

414
00:22:42,380 --> 00:22:45,960
Yes, my work tends to keep
me cooped up in my room,

415
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:47,580
so he says I should broaden my horizons.

416
00:22:47,580 --> 00:22:49,700
He takes me all sorts of places.

417
00:22:50,460 --> 00:22:53,800
The thing about him not
letting me sleep last night,

418
00:22:54,760 --> 00:22:55,720
That was...

419
00:22:56,280 --> 00:22:58,740
That was me,
I made him wait for my name drafts,

420
00:22:58,740 --> 00:23:00,260
since my manuscript was
about to miss its deadline.

421
00:23:02,740 --> 00:23:04,331
Hahaha, so,

422
00:23:04,381 --> 00:23:07,500
it seems we totally got the wrong idea.

423
00:23:07,500 --> 00:23:08,960
Good for you, Honda.

424
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:09,377
Yes,

425
00:23:09,427 --> 00:23:13,480
but you could've just told
us that from the start.

426
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:16,355
Civil servants are forbidden
from having side jobs,

427
00:23:16,405 --> 00:23:18,600
and if it gets out, we'd be fired.

428
00:23:19,180 --> 00:23:21,040
Don't worry, I'll keep it a secret.

429
00:23:22,540 --> 00:23:24,104
Sorry

430
00:23:24,154 --> 00:23:28,280
Would you like to come to my workplace now?

431
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,840
Eh

432
00:23:30,280 --> 00:23:31,620
Go on, Honda, get going.

433
00:23:32,740 --> 00:23:33,700
How about you two come along too?

434
00:23:33,900 --> 00:23:34,700
No way!

435
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:37,240
We're not that tactless, you know.

436
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:38,500
Come on, off you go!

437
00:23:39,580 --> 00:23:40,920
Well then, we're off!

438
00:23:42,260 --> 00:23:44,340
Isn't that wonderful, Ryo-sama.

439
00:23:44,340 --> 00:23:46,600
Yeah, well then, us too.

440
00:23:46,600 --> 00:23:49,660
Shall we go treat Honda to a drink?

441
00:23:49,660 --> 00:23:50,480
Sounds good.

442
00:23:50,480 --> 00:23:51,980
Let's go, let's go!

443
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:09,180
Chief, why do they have to take
away my bonus over what Sakonji did?

444
00:24:09,180 --> 00:24:13,200
Sure, I'm the one who gave
Sakonji Tokimeki Memorial,

445
00:24:13,200 --> 00:24:18,340
but whether Sakonji becomes a pervert or not has nothing to do with me,
does it?

446
00:24:18,340 --> 00:24:22,020
Next time: Forbidden Beautiful Girl Doll,
so look forward to it.

447
00:24:30,620 --> 00:24:37,240
People gossip that I'm a woman
who can't fall in love, but

448
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:41,940
I have so many things I want to do.

449
00:24:41,940 --> 00:24:52,020
I want to ride a motorbike
across the vast desert.

450
00:24:52,020 --> 00:24:59,160
I want to be freer than a bird.

451
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:07,100
A lady's dreams change
as fast as a kaleidoscope.

